{"t": 477.97, "kind": "proposal", "iteration": 2, "k": 1, "move": "new_topology", "name": "SSHI_Doubler_Zener", "rationale": "The previous FBR-based design failed to provide sufficient voltage on S2 and S4, while exhibiting high ripple and slow settling. A full-bridge rectifier has two diode drops and does not boost the voltage. By replacing the FBR with a full-wave voltage doubler (Greinacher cells for both half-cycles), we can significantly increase the output voltage, which helps meet the 1.8V minimum even under heavy loads or weak excitation. The SSHI flip (L-S) is kept to maximize the charge extracted from the piezo capacitance. A Zener clamp is essential to prevent the doubler from exceeding the 3.6V maximum on S3. A balanced storage capacitor value will be optimized to resolve the trade-off between ripple (requiring larger C) and startup/settling (requiring smaller C).", "circuit": {"move": "new_topology", "name": "SSHI_Doubler_Zener", "rationale": "The previous FBR-based design failed to provide sufficient voltage on S2 and S4, while exhibiting high ripple and slow settling. A full-bridge rectifier has two diode drops and does not boost the voltage. By replacing the FBR with a full-wave voltage doubler (Greinacher cells for both half-cycles), we can significantly increase the output voltage, which helps meet the 1.8V minimum even under heavy loads or weak excitation. The SSHI flip (L-S) is kept to maximize the charge extracted from the piezo capacitance. A Zener clamp is essential to prevent the doubler from exceeding the 3.6V maximum on S3. A balanced storage capacitor value will be optimized to resolve the trade-off between ripple (requiring larger C) and startup/settling (requiring smaller C).", "done": false, "components": [{"id": "L1", "type": "L", "nodes": ["pzp", "n_flip"], "value": 0.01}, {"id": "S1", "type": "S", "nodes": ["n_flip", "pzn"], "ctrl": "G1"}, {"id": "G1", "type": "SYNC", "ton": 5e-05, "phase": 0.0, "edges": "both"}, {"id": "D1", "type": "D", "nodes": ["pzp", "n_pump1"], "model": "DSCH"}, {"id": "C1", "type": "C", "nodes": ["n_pump1", "0"], "value": 1e-06}, {"id": "D2", "type": "D", "nodes": ["n_pump1", "out"], "model": "DSCH"}, {"id": "D3", "type": "D", "nodes": ["pzn", "n_pump2"], "model": "DSCH"}, {"id": "C2", "type": "C", "nodes": ["n_pump2", "0"], "value": 1e-06}, {"id": "D4", "type": "D", "nodes": ["n_pump2", "out"], "model": "DSCH"}, {"id": "D5", "type": "D", "nodes": ["0", "out"], "model": "DZ33"}, {"id": "C3", "type": "C", "nodes": ["out", "0"], "value": 1e-05}]}}
